{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Elemental Mastery transforms Primordial Blast from Runic Brand damage (#1025)",
  "contract": [
    "Tooltip 806711: damage dealt by Runic Brand has a $h% (ProcChance 33) chance to transform your Primordial",
    "Blast into a random unique elemental version of itself.",
    "806711 effect 0 is PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL 725391; Spell.dbc gives it ProcFlags 0, so no proc entry existed.",
    "Runic Brand's weapon hits are 712322 (the only family 38 spell with mask0 0x20, melee class), triggered",
    "twice per cast by the brand_weapons script, so the proc must accept triggered spells.",
    "725391 is Ascension effect 184 (trigger random spell, server group 7015), which the core left as EffectNULL.",
    "Its tooltip 'Your Primordial Blast has transformed into Stratus!' names the group: the 6 sec dummy auras",
    "Ignis 713003, Lithos 717070, Hydros 718040 and Stratus 721085 ('...has transformed into X!').",
    "Each names an elemental Primordial Blast with the same family flags: Ignis 712668, Lithos 712858, Hydros",
    "713002 and Stratus 712404 (matching names and icons).",
    "While a transform is active, Primordial Blast 800732 stands in as its elemental version on the server,",
    "casting it replaces the cast and consumes the transform, and a new transform replaces an older one.",
    "Expiry restores Primordial Blast. 40 Runic Brand hits at 33% fail to proc with probability 1e-7.",
    "A Runemaster without the talent keeps Primordial Blast. Weapon skills and Dual Wield are fixture setup."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
